{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19036","headline":"乐天池馆夏景方妍白莲初开彩舟空泊唯邀缁侣因以戏之 · 刘禹锡","name":"乐天池馆夏景方妍白莲初开彩舟空泊唯邀缁侣因以戏之","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"池馆今正好，主人何寂然。\n白莲方出水，碧树未鸣蝉。\n静室宵闻磬，斋厨晚绝烟。\n蕃僧如共载，应不是神仙。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘禹锡","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_19036.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19036","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}